<title>USA: Hvide Marine sets repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Hvide Marine sets repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hvide Marine Inc said Friday it approved the repurchase, from time to time and under certain conditions, of up to $1 million shares of its Class A common stock on the open market.</p>
<p>These repurchases will be conducted at such times and at such prices as are deemed appropriate and in keeping with management's responsibility to maximize shareholder value, the company said.</p>
</text>
